{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：19:48 2026-10-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：19:48 2026-10-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：19:48 2026-10-28 HKT</p><img alt=\"「海洋帝君」爆67倍W。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/83b58f0db7ff3e7959877c084caef012/2026-10/r2_7.jpg\"/><p>楊明綸繼國慶日贏「領駿精彩」爆38倍冷W後，又於今晚全泥夜賽炮製冷品，且賠率更冷；騎者於第二場策石廄「海洋帝君」壓倒另一冷馬東廄「架勢奇爸」，成功爆出67倍W，兩駒構成的連贏位派彩更達11,049元。</p><p>「海洋帝君」之前在港廿二戰未勝，上仗出爭田草千四米更大敗逾十七個馬位跑尾二，但今晚轉戰泥地一哩即予人驚喜，輕鬆後上把對手一網成擒。</p><p>本周五（10月30日）是徐雨石的66歲生日，「海洋帝君」這場頭馬正好替練者提早壽。</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/945e6524327b098f4cfc303bf0fa5d34/2026-10/0d51c4e8-460d-4ac0-a526-4eab91c689cf.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f4efd6a7b1e0aa8190a010263be21b0a/2026-10/1db1edd6-6d26-4361-b382-cd1418faeb9b.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/994a0194012e83675d12941873473c54/2026-10/27b19f34-19d6-463f-acac-6abff7a2dfd3.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0967201dd6b917323d131e07be3b2900/2026-10/32fcc948-0d73-43e7-925c-5be78ee3b72b.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/225557c0cdbb569a972c5d8597a25167/2026-10/55ea4ffd-7a6a-4969-ae82-0d6bb88e898b.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/846ce76f8fda1403ca7239031de65353/2026-10/084c5955-d601-493e-bc2c-aa6369cc60ef.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b73985c71186e8802210c303277befdb/2026-10/2849e727-9748-4e79-be72-d8f3a4bcde99.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ad1271a992e05dcecef6af4cb21ec70/2026-10/5946e7f6-e67c-4e5c-9920-efd6468aacc9.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b2650daa8f872abef8a191263994b022/2026-10/ac62154f-4372-475a-8e31-34c3079eaa07.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c43a4ff31c459947c773d0d0f6240c0/2026-10/b9d13c74-aa3a-4a55-bfe3-0f9acc1bca70.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cb5be0eb81eeacf88f2d19d5635dd704/2026-10/cbef5118-f242-4e84-8bce-14d71c73f0c2.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/449e60fbca335e6e165b7eba181627bf/2026-10/d8b8d119-44d8-44e7-af51-e816cc375986.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5983bb0c21f63c9f229076ee8907b56e/2026-10/d3211618-e8af-49d5-858e-2080f3c4a443.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/faad3b46d9fe4f9108a046c159c7ccdf/2026-10/dcf722cf-b1f8-481c-b8cf-098d6703f1e4.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4953c8ff0b93efe5441e03bd323fcfc3/2026-10/ef39bcf6-35f3-434b-a81d-a934633fba1a.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/36f39d1d7d3cd38f165f70f61b7da4ac/2026-10/f903520e-837b-4379-a413-e67124ea31ff.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:01:19.067233+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":301,"images":17,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T11:48:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:18:37.400161+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T11:58:39.944538+00:00","content_hash":"753dbaf0cdffda2207a488b9eca0ced5f5262f46b435c4f4d9dbbeb0ba8178fc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}